In the proposed perchloroethylene (PCE) risk management rule, EPA included an exemption from the 
rule’s prohibitions for products that contain PCE at a concentration of less than 0.1% by weight.42 For 
consumer products, EPA “found that, when adjusting parameters for product mass and duration of use to 
