throughout ACC member companies; and Communicate authentically with communities about challenges and 
solutions for a safer, healthier and more sustainable way of life. Our vision is a world made better by chemistry, 
where people live happier, healthier, and more prosperous lives, safely and sustainably—for generations to come. 
2 July 24, 2024 press release from the Office of Chemical Safety and Pollution Prevention entitled “Biden-Harris 
